@niyongsheng/free-vision-skill README · Tools：- `view_image` — describe image content (scene, people, QR, composition)
- `ocr_image` — extract text; `layout=true` for table structure + coordinates

Input: http(s) URL / base64 / local path.

@niyongsheng/free-vision-skill README · Paste-to-path (Web UI)：Paste (⌘V) an image in the DSH web input box → its local absolute path is
inserted. Loopback-only upload, magic-byte checked: PNG / JPEG / GIF / WebP /
HEIC / HEIF.
